# `npm run build:app`: the iPhone app (capacitor.config.ts). It is always the store edition, and as it
# isn't served by the site, it names the API and the site (for links people share) in full.
VITE_EDITION=store
VITE_API_URL=https://matchnight.hotspotkeeper.com/api
VITE_SITE_URL=https://matchnight.hotspotkeeper.com/
